@emlavoie 10/23/2024
This folder includes updated input files and associated with 100 keV Au into quartz simulation.
DUMP file associated with the run is very large -- I have included the first few hundred time steps.

Also important to mention -- this is no way an "absolutely correct" simulation. 
Interatomic potentials are still under discussion and it is very much encouraged to keep experimenting with this degree of freedom.
If you are within the NSF GCR MDDM collaboration, it's encouraged to create your own branch on this GitHub and upload new results or summary of.
At the very least, updated input scripts and any code associated with the manupulation of those scripts. 

Please contact me if something isn't working, or if there are missing files, or if you think this repository is outdated. I will try my best to keep up with it!
